{"id":27671,"slug":"all-these-women","title":"All These Women","year":1964,"country":"Sweden","duration":80,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27671-all-these-women","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/a542db89247489d8305dafba6620ad4e/gNegY1fNjIg43C6vk8OCMNf2g1aS35_large.jpg","description":"\nConceived as an amusing diversion in the wake of Ingmar Bergman’s despairing trilogy, this comedy is the director’s first film in color, and it is an opulent visual feast. Working from a bawdy screenplay he cowrote with actor Erland Josephson, about a supercilious critic drawn into the dizzying orbit of a famous cellist, Bergman brings together buoyant comic turns by a number of his frequent collaborators, including Jarl Kulle, Eva Dahlbeck, Harriet Andersson, and Bibi Andersson. All These Women, in which Bergman pokes fun at the pretensions of drawing-room art, possesses a distinctly playful atmosphere and carefree cadences.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jarl Kulle","role":"Cornelius","slug":"jarl-kulle"},{"actor":"Bibi Andersson","role":"Bumblebee","slug":"bibi-andersson"},{"actor":"Harriet Andersson","role":"Isolde","slug":"harriet-andersson"},{"actor":"Eva Dahlbeck","role":"Adelaide","slug":"eva-dahlbeck"},{"actor":"Karin Kavli","role":"Madame Tussaud","slug":"karin-kavli"},{"actor":"Gertrud Fridh","role":"Traviata","slug":"gertrud-fridh"},{"actor":"Mona Malm","role":"Cecilia","slug":"mona-malm"},{"actor":"Barbro Hiort af Ornäs","role":"Beatrice","slug":"barbro-hiort-af-ornas"},{"actor":"Allan Edwall","role":"Jillker","slug":"allan-edwall"},{"actor":"Georg Funkquist","role":"Tristan","slug":"georg-funkquist"},{"actor":"Carl Billquist","role":"The young man","slug":"carl-billquist"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Screenplay","per